# Savefiles that are known not to load, and why.
#
# One "name: reason" a line; '#' comments.  The suite reads this and treats a
# listed file's refusal as expected -- but it also fails if a listed file
# *loads*, because a manifest that outlives its reason is worse than none: it
# would silently excuse the next real break.
#
# Take an entry out when the file loads again, rather than leaving it here.

# DEC-50: the magic realms replace the spell content of four realms outright.
# spell_flags[] and spell_order[] are stored by flat index across a class's
# books, so these four cannot be loaded without handing them somebody else's
# spells.  The project owner accepted this on 1 September 2026 -- the game is
# pre-release -- and the loader refuses rather than guessing.  The other 31
# characters in this directory have no spells recorded and are unaffected.
